    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1071500/extras/61460b5f31854598d497e534a437a4d2.avif?t=1752413281\" /></div> <br>                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       <br><strong>The Secret of FYNDEMOOR Park</strong> a game so big only the pc can hold it . You are Foster a would be gangster...something is a foot in this city and its up to you to find out what`s what! A graphic adventure game that`s never been so easy using the retro game engine system walking talking, taking is as simple as pointing the cursor and pressing a button . <strong>The secret of FYNDEMOOR Park</strong> offers adventure gamers a new kind of story telling experience that includes complex puzzles and conversations and side splitting humour . Available from<strong> CRAZY EYE MEDIA</strong> <strong>The secret of FYNDEMOOR Park</strong> sets new standards for pc gaming.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1071500/extras/0f42f2aab584531b4e4a1c4f3d78bd22.avif?t=1752413281\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">KEY FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>16-bit Retro Arcade graphics</strong></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Classic CRT-TV screen</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>90`s aesthetics</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Classic point and click adventure</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Satire of the decade with Politically incorrect humour</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Aliens, talking horse`s,<strong>swinger`s party`s</strong>,flying mermaids plus loads more entertainment</li></ul>  <ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Go on a daring adventure in your attempt to become the most infamous gangster in <strong>FYNDEMOOR</strong> city     </li></ul>  <br> <ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Intuitive game interface and controls provide a more interactive gameplay experience    </li></ul>  <br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>  Intentional in<strong> game bugs</strong>  and <strong>comical glitches</strong> followed by badly scripted animations to give the game a<strong> authentic  90`s Charm</strong>...<br>that sets it apart from the rest   </li></ul>                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       <ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> The first and only 16-bit arcade point and click adventure game </li></ul><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1071500/extras/3b50c2bcb572270ccf5132568f477d87.poster.avif?t=1752413281\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1071500/extras/3b50c2bcb572270ccf5132568f477d87.webm?t=1752413281\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1071500/extras/3b50c2bcb572270ccf5132568f477d87.mp4?t=1752413281\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
